==Battleground==
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns.

